⛵ ship · main → feat/add-vat-rate

  Keys
    Enter           ship (in a text field: next field)
    Ctrl+Enter, F2  ship from anywhere, a text field included
    Ctrl+L          commit locally only: no push, no pull request
    Tab, Shift+Tab  next or previous field
    ↑ ↓             move in the files and the parts
    Space           select or unselect a file; ship only a part
    ← →             fold or unfold the files
    ?               this help (outside a text field)
    Esc, Ctrl+C     cancel: nothing changes

  In the commits
    ↑ ↓              move among the commits and their changes
    Enter            on a commit: edit its title (Enter again to keep it)
    Shift+↑ ↓, K J   on a commit: move it one place up or down
                     on a change: move it to the commit above or below
    1 to 9           on a change: move it to that commit
    m                on a commit: merge the commit below into it
    s                switch between these commits and one commit
  A commit left without changes goes away.

  Any key closes this help.
